      "id": "claim_f6ee1be411cc44af8ce963e1af7842d1",
      "statement": "OpenWiki resolves its state/home directory to ~/.openwiki by default (os.homedir() joined with .openwiki), but OPENWIKI_CONFIG_DIR overrides it, with manual tilde expansion because path.resolve does not expand a leading ~.",
