    {
      "id": "claim_c8ab56cdd3884818ab3dfeb904fbefdc",
      "statement": "MANAGED_ENV_KEYS is the single source of truth for every env var OpenWiki reads or persists, in file-write order, and both CREDENTIAL_DIAGNOSTIC_ENV_KEYS and DEBUG_ENV_KEYS are derived from it by filtering so they cannot drift out of sync when a new managed key is added; it includes OPENWIKI_BEDROCK_MAX_TOKENS_ENV_KEY alongside the other Bedrock and provider keys.",
