    {
      "id": "claim_c32885067b064c12a35961c9dd8d5c96",
      "statement": "On save, keys with an empty value are dropped rather than persisted as KEY= (which would read back as configured), deprecated keys are removed, and process.env is updated to mirror the file except for keys whose value came from a shell export at startup, which are left untouched.",
